1
00:00:01,921 --> 00:00:03,298
Hoo, hoo!

2
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,337
Hi!

3
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:06,414
It's me, Popcorn!

4
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:11,767
Welcome to Popcorn Tales, the
cozy nest of bedtime stories.

5
00:00:12,079 --> 00:00:15,503
Hug your teddy, because
tonight's story is:

6
00:00:15,553 --> 00:00:18,752
Beauty, the Beast and the Magic Ring!

7
00:00:23,334 --> 00:00:29,346
Once upon a time, in a big city by the
sea, there lived a very rich merchant,

8
00:00:29,418 --> 00:00:33,512
in a huge house with his three
sons and his three daughters.

9
00:00:34,171 --> 00:00:39,051
His youngest daughter was so kind and
so lovely that everyone called her

10
00:00:39,101 --> 00:00:40,301
Beauty.

11
00:00:40,688 --> 00:00:45,582
Her two older sisters were proud and
only thought about dresses and jewels,

12
00:00:45,632 --> 00:00:49,991
but Beauty loved reading good books
and looking after the flowers.

13
00:00:56,893 --> 00:01:00,140
One day, some very sad news arrived:

14
00:01:00,197 --> 00:01:04,952
the merchant's ships had been lost in
a storm, and he was left with almost

15
00:01:05,002 --> 00:01:06,202
nothing.

16
00:01:06,682 --> 00:01:10,215
The family went to live in a
simple house in the countryside,

17
00:01:10,265 --> 00:01:13,859
and Beauty got up before the sun
to bake bread for the family.

18
00:01:16,414 --> 00:01:20,973
What a boring life, there are no parties
at all out here in the countryside!

19
00:01:21,023 --> 00:01:24,646
the eldest sister complained,
lying on the sofa.

20
00:01:25,282 --> 00:01:28,213
Beauty smiled calmly and answered:

21
00:01:28,263 --> 00:01:32,026
Complaining won't bring the ships back,
so I would rather work cheerfully and

22
00:01:32,076 --> 00:01:33,363
help our father.

23
00:01:33,953 --> 00:01:35,330
Hoo, hoo!

24
00:01:35,434 --> 00:01:37,878
What a kind-hearted young woman.

25
00:01:38,008 --> 00:01:40,626
I'm going to keep an eye on this family,

26
00:01:40,676 --> 00:01:44,132
Popcorn said, from a
branch of the apple tree.

27
00:01:45,219 --> 00:01:50,016
A year later, news came that one of
the ships had turned up at the harbor,

28
00:01:50,066 --> 00:01:52,841
and the merchant got ready
to travel to the city.

29
00:01:53,446 --> 00:01:57,031
Father, please bring me a silk
dress and a pearl necklace!

30
00:01:57,143 --> 00:01:59,057
the eldest sister asked.

31
00:01:59,641 --> 00:02:03,653
And for me, Father, please bring a
feathered hat and golden earrings!

32
00:02:03,703 --> 00:02:05,367
the middle sister asked.

33
00:02:05,941 --> 00:02:09,613
And what about you, my dear girl, what
would you like me to bring from the

34
00:02:09,663 --> 00:02:10,391
city?

35
00:02:10,441 --> 00:02:13,827
the merchant asked,
looking at his youngest.

36
00:02:14,465 --> 00:02:17,276
Beauty thought for a moment and answered:

37
00:02:17,326 --> 00:02:21,313
All I want is a rose, Father, because
not a single one grows here in the

38
00:02:21,363 --> 00:02:22,588
countryside.

39
00:02:23,202 --> 00:02:28,616
But the trip went wrong, and the merchant
came back as poor as when he left.

40
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:35,054
On his way home, it began to snow very
hard, and the merchant got lost in a

41
00:02:35,104 --> 00:02:37,615
dark, frozen forest.

42
00:02:38,281 --> 00:02:43,203
He was already shivering with cold,
when he saw an enormous palace,

43
00:02:43,253 --> 00:02:47,014
with every window lit
and the gates wide open.

44
00:02:52,761 --> 00:02:58,517
Inside there was nobody, only a crackling
fire and a warm supper on the table,

45
00:02:58,567 --> 00:03:04,328
so the merchant ate, said thank you out
loud, and fell asleep in a soft bed.

46
00:03:04,971 --> 00:03:09,727
In the morning, on his way out, he
walked through a garden full of roses,

47
00:03:09,777 --> 00:03:12,913
and he remembered what
Beauty had asked for.

48
00:03:13,598 --> 00:03:19,423
He picked a red rose, very carefully,
and at that very moment he heard heavy

49
00:03:19,473 --> 00:03:21,178
footsteps behind him.

50
00:03:24,083 --> 00:03:30,511
It was an enormous Beast, covered in
grey fur, with round ears and sad eyes.

51
00:03:31,036 --> 00:03:36,210
I gave you food and shelter, and you
take my roses, which I love so much?

52
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:40,201
the Beast said, in a
deep and grumpy voice.

53
00:03:40,767 --> 00:03:44,277
Please forgive me, sir, the rose
was for my youngest daughter,

54
00:03:44,327 --> 00:03:47,116
Beauty, who asked for
nothing else as a present,

55
00:03:47,166 --> 00:03:49,885
the merchant said, on his knees.

56
00:03:50,510 --> 00:03:53,177
The Beast took a deep breath and said:

57
00:03:53,227 --> 00:03:57,334
Then you may go home, but in three months
you must come back and live here in

58
00:03:57,384 --> 00:03:58,584
the castle.

59
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:02,813
Or one of your daughters may come in
your place, but only if she truly wants

60
00:04:02,863 --> 00:04:04,063
to come.

61
00:04:04,475 --> 00:04:09,736
And the Beast even gave the merchant a
chest full of gold coins to take home.

62
00:04:10,333 --> 00:04:11,175
Hoo!

63
00:04:11,225 --> 00:04:15,691
That Beast looks grumpy, but I
think he has a very big heart,

64
00:04:15,741 --> 00:04:19,321
Popcorn whispered, hiding among the roses.

65
00:04:20,398 --> 00:04:26,098
At home, the merchant gave Beauty her
rose and told everyone everything,

66
00:04:26,148 --> 00:04:28,117
with tears in his eyes.

67
00:04:28,729 --> 00:04:32,314
All of this happened because of
the rose that Beauty asked for!

68
00:04:32,409 --> 00:04:36,115
the eldest sister
complained, folding her arms.

69
00:04:36,695 --> 00:04:40,308
I was the one who asked for the rose,
so I am the one who will go and live in

70
00:04:40,358 --> 00:04:41,995
the castle, Father.

71
00:04:42,297 --> 00:04:45,230
I am going because I want
to, with all my heart,

72
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:49,110
Beauty said, in a calm and steady voice.

73
00:04:49,767 --> 00:04:54,662
Three months later, Beauty and her
father climbed onto the horse and rode

74
00:04:54,712 --> 00:04:57,320
together to the palace in the forest.

75
00:05:04,688 --> 00:05:09,819
Soon after, the Beast appeared at the
door, and Beauty trembled a little,

76
00:05:09,869 --> 00:05:11,866
but she took a deep breath.

77
00:05:12,378 --> 00:05:16,195
Good evening, young lady, did you
come here because you wanted to,

78
00:05:16,245 --> 00:05:17,732
with all your heart?

79
00:05:17,782 --> 00:05:20,488
the Beast asked, in his deep voice.

80
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:25,024
Yes, Beast, I came because I
wanted to, with all my heart,

81
00:05:25,074 --> 00:05:26,988
Beauty answered politely.

82
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:33,268
The next day, her father gave his
daughter a long hug and rode back home.

83
00:05:34,331 --> 00:05:39,468
Beauty was given an enormous bedroom,
with a bookcase full of books and,

84
00:05:39,623 --> 00:05:44,190
above the door, golden letters
saying that she was the queen there.

85
00:05:51,084 --> 00:05:55,922
Every evening, at nine o'clock, the
Beast came to have supper with Beauty,

86
00:05:55,972 --> 00:05:58,900
and the two of them
talked for a long time.

87
00:05:59,541 --> 00:06:03,964
The Beast was kind and polite, and
little by little Beauty stopped being

88
00:06:04,014 --> 00:06:08,747
afraid, and began to look forward
to nine o'clock every evening.

89
00:06:09,392 --> 00:06:15,737
But every night, before he went away,
the Beast asked the very same question.

90
00:06:16,286 --> 00:06:19,856
Beauty, will you marry me and
stay here with me forever?

91
00:06:19,906 --> 00:06:22,278
the Beast asked, very slowly.

92
00:06:22,889 --> 00:06:27,076
I can't say yes, Beast, but I like you
very much, and I will always be your

93
00:06:27,126 --> 00:06:27,841
friend,

94
00:06:27,891 --> 00:06:29,778
Beauty answered gently.

95
00:06:30,444 --> 00:06:35,366
The Beast would sigh, wish her good
night, and walk slowly away down the long

96
00:06:35,416 --> 00:06:36,616
hallway.

97
00:06:42,802 --> 00:06:46,758
One night, a magic mirror
in her room began to glow,

98
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:52,494
and Beauty saw her father ill in bed,
because he missed his daughter so much.

99
00:06:53,091 --> 00:06:57,391
Beast, my father is ill because he
misses me, please let me go home for just

100
00:06:57,441 --> 00:06:59,978
one week, and I promise I will come back,

101
00:07:00,028 --> 00:07:01,317
Beauty begged.

102
00:07:01,871 --> 00:07:06,836
You may go, Beauty, but keep your
promise, because I feel very sad when you

103
00:07:06,886 --> 00:07:08,017
are not here,

104
00:07:08,067 --> 00:07:09,315
the Beast said.

105
00:07:09,972 --> 00:07:13,683
The Beast gave Beauty a
golden ring and explained:

106
00:07:13,733 --> 00:07:17,739
Whenever you want to come back, just
put this ring on the table before you go

107
00:07:17,789 --> 00:07:18,989
to sleep.

108
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:24,580
That night, Beauty put the ring on
the table and, when she woke up,

109
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,627
she was in her father's house!

110
00:07:30,248 --> 00:07:33,823
Her father was so happy that
he felt better right away,

111
00:07:33,873 --> 00:07:37,967
but her sisters were jealous
of Beauty's lovely dresses.

112
00:07:38,590 --> 00:07:42,776
Let's make Beauty stay here longer, and
then the Beast will be cross with her,

113
00:07:42,885 --> 00:07:46,035
the eldest sister whispered
to the middle sister.

114
00:07:46,656 --> 00:07:51,050
On the day Beauty was meant to leave,
the two of them rubbed an onion on their

115
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,847
eyes, to pretend they were crying.

116
00:07:54,459 --> 00:07:58,508
Oh, Beauty, please stay a few more days
with us, because we are going to miss

117
00:07:58,558 --> 00:07:59,886
you so terribly!

118
00:07:59,936 --> 00:08:02,822
the middle sister said, with onion tears.

119
00:08:03,447 --> 00:08:06,583
Beauty had such a good heart
that she believed them,

120
00:08:06,655 --> 00:08:08,972
and she stayed for one more week.

121
00:08:10,067 --> 00:08:14,628
On the tenth night, Beauty dreamed
that the Beast was lying in the palace

122
00:08:14,678 --> 00:08:19,189
garden, near the fountain,
weak and very sad.

123
00:08:19,778 --> 00:08:23,628
How ungrateful I have been to the
Beast, who was always so kind to me,

124
00:08:23,678 --> 00:08:25,294
and I broke my promise!

125
00:08:25,344 --> 00:08:27,661
Beauty said, getting out of bed.

126
00:08:28,325 --> 00:08:31,789
Beauty put the ring on the
table, fell asleep again,

127
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:33,780
and woke up in the palace.

128
00:08:37,368 --> 00:08:40,768
Beauty remembered her dream
and ran out into the garden,

129
00:08:40,882 --> 00:08:44,379
and there lay the Beast, on
the grass near the fountain,

130
00:08:44,562 --> 00:08:47,212
too weak from missing her so much.

131
00:08:50,145 --> 00:08:55,123
Beauty scooped up cool water from the
fountain, gently wet the Beast's face,

132
00:08:55,173 --> 00:08:57,976
and the Beast slowly opened his eyes.

133
00:09:00,507 --> 00:09:04,069
Don't be sad, Beast, because
I have come back forever.

134
00:09:04,363 --> 00:09:07,763
I have found out that I truly
love you, and I will marry you,

135
00:09:07,813 --> 00:09:11,324
Beauty said, holding
the Beast's furry hand.

136
00:09:15,429 --> 00:09:19,573
At that very moment, the whole
palace filled with lights,

137
00:09:19,623 --> 00:09:23,190
and colorful fireworks
burst open in the sky.

138
00:09:23,872 --> 00:09:28,947
Beauty looked again, and where the Beast
had been, there stood a young prince,

139
00:09:28,997 --> 00:09:32,980
with fair hair and kind
eyes, smiling at her.

140
00:09:33,623 --> 00:09:38,498
I am the Beast, Beauty, and a fairy's
spell could only end when someone loved

141
00:09:38,548 --> 00:09:39,732
me for my heart,

142
00:09:39,782 --> 00:09:41,335
the prince explained.

143
00:09:45,010 --> 00:09:49,493
Just then, a fairy in a silver
dress arrived in the garden,

144
00:09:49,593 --> 00:09:52,646
bringing Beauty's father
and brothers with her.

145
00:09:53,303 --> 00:09:56,759
The sisters came too,
with their heads bowed.

146
00:09:57,370 --> 00:10:00,901
Dear Beauty, please forgive us,
because we were jealous of you,

147
00:10:00,951 --> 00:10:02,662
and now we are truly sorry,

148
00:10:02,737 --> 00:10:05,067
the sisters said, ashamed.

149
00:10:05,718 --> 00:10:10,362
Beauty gave both of her sisters
a big, tight hug and answered:

150
00:10:10,412 --> 00:10:14,687
I have already forgiven you, and I
want us always to be a loving family.

151
00:10:15,323 --> 00:10:18,968
Those who forgive with all their heart
become even more beautiful on the

152
00:10:19,018 --> 00:10:22,380
inside, so be very happy, my dears,

153
00:10:22,430 --> 00:10:25,219
the fairy said, with a smile.

154
00:10:25,824 --> 00:10:30,788
Not long after, Beauty and the prince
were married, and her sisters began to

155
00:10:30,838 --> 00:10:34,780
visit the castle every
Sunday, bringing apple cake.

156
00:10:35,367 --> 00:10:36,744
Hoo, hoo!

157
00:10:36,849 --> 00:10:39,527
What a happy ending for everyone!

158
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:44,811
Remember, my friends, the truest kind
of beauty is the beauty that lives

159
00:10:44,861 --> 00:10:46,549
inside our hearts,

160
00:10:46,599 --> 00:10:49,971
Popcorn said, blinking her big eyes.

161
00:10:57,276 --> 00:10:58,476
The End.

162
00:11:00,191 --> 00:11:00,903
Hoo...

163
00:11:00,953 --> 00:11:01,977
Psst!

164
00:11:02,027 --> 00:11:03,599
Are you still awake?

165
00:11:03,752 --> 00:11:05,805
Did you like tonight's story?

166
00:11:05,921 --> 00:11:09,296
Beauty showed us that true
beauty lives in the heart,

167
00:11:09,346 --> 00:11:14,400
and that kindness, gratitude and keeping
our promises matter much more than

168
00:11:14,450 --> 00:11:15,788
the way we look.

169
00:11:16,082 --> 00:11:20,388
Good night, sleep tight, and
have the sweetest dreams.

170
00:11:20,684 --> 00:11:25,582
Grown-ups: if you enjoyed it,
please subscribe to Popcorn Tales,

171
00:11:25,632 --> 00:11:28,037
for more stories at bedtime.

172
00:11:28,341 --> 00:11:29,541
Hoo...

